-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY LINGUISTIC DATA LICENSES (DOWNLOADED AT BUILD/RUNTIME VIA cjp-etl)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT bundle third-party dictionary dumps directly in Git.
When running `cjp-etl fetch` / `docker compose up`, the ETL pipeline downloads
and indexes the following open linguistic datasets under their respective
licenses:

1. Czech Wiktionary (via Kaikki.org / Wiktextract JSONL extract)
   - URL: https://cs.wiktionary.org / https://kaikki.org/dictionary/downloads/cs/
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)

2. UniMorph Czech (Wiktionary morphological paradigms)
   - URL: https://github.com/unimorph/ces
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)

3. Czech Hyphenation Patterns (csTeX / LibreOffice hyph_cs_CZ.dic)
   - Author: Pavel Janík & contributors
   - URL: https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries/tree/master/cs_CZ
   - License: GNU General Public License (GPL)

4. Czech Hunspell Dictionary & LibreOffice Thesaurus (optional, enabled by default)
   - Authors: Petr Kolář, Miroslav Pošta & contributors (cs_CZ.dic, cs_CZ.aff, th_cs_CZ.dat)
   - URL: https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries/tree/master/cs_CZ
   - License: GNU General Public License (GPL) / GNU Free Documentation License (GFDL)
   - Note: Can be omitted by building the database with `--include-gpl=false` (`make build-db-cc`)
     and running the API server with `--hunspell=false` (`CJP_INCLUDE_GPL=false`, `CJP_USE_HUNSPELL=false`).
